<title>RUSSIA: Volymerets named Aeroflot first deputy.</title>
<headline>Volymerets named Aeroflot first deputy.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aeroflot -Russian International Airlines chief executive Valery Okulov has appointed Anatoly Volymerets as his first deputy, a company spokesman said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Volymerets, 46, worked as a pilot for Aeroflot for 11 years. He was company flight director since December 1996.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
